{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure Forest Clicker: Craft Your Way to a Perfect Yard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Treasure Forest Clicker, a relaxing yet addictive clicker game where your goal is to tidy up a messy yard by clicking on trash and debris. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean, discover hidden items and resources that you can use to craft better tools, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making your cleaning efforts faster and more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Satisfying Clicking Gameplay: Tap to remove junk and uncover useful materials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Crafting System: Combine found items to create advanced tools and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Hidden Treasures: Search for rare diamonds\u2014collect them all to unlock a special reward by the end of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Progress &amp; Improve: Start small, but with smart crafting, turn your basic cleanup into a high-efficiency operation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you transform this cluttered mess into a spotless paradise? Start clicking, crafting, and collecting today!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"click on 50 objects","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772660/647f48464ef0da047d5531daf94cb319818f52f1.jpg"},{"name":"click on 200 objects","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772660/b857b0336e98cb7d6bbb1947621dd8e4a514888a.jpg"},{"name":"click on 450 objects","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772660/32edf7f8fad31b61da64e0dfc9a72fa6bc234313.jpg"},{"name":"go to 5 locations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772660/0f235374888ad4dbc9d689fa4b46715178d549bb.jpg"},{"name":"go to 10 locations","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3772660/f3af7a59